#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Materialize the Run8-R2C M1/M2 closure ledgers from current evidence.

This compiler never reads environment values, invokes partners, executes the
public Power estate, or promotes preserved canonical evidence to current source.
It reconstructs typed catalog state and binds it to current local build proof.
"""

